# Scratch files made while editing the app.
#
# index.html.before-2.9.0-articles was a hand-made backup taken before a large
# edit. It is byte-identical to the committed build at that time, so git
# already holds it — but it sits in the working tree, and a plain `git add -A`
# would publish a stale 1.1 MB duplicate of the app to the live repo.
*.before-*
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp

# OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
